@title Cooling what-if: a layout move previewed in 3D
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# At 1366x768 (the 1920 picture is scenario 406: the window sits elsewhere, so the list scrolls at other points). The cabinet with a hot device on a crowded rail. The wizard ranks the fixes; the ones that move devices draw green boxes where the devices would stand, and the table says "Cooler layout" moves. Nothing is stored until Apply.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-whatif-layout.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Cooling what-if"
wait 20
click_text "Try the fixes"
wait_s 120
expect "Devices over limit"
expect "Model estimate"
shot ranked
scroll 250 560 -600
wait 10
shot ranked-scrolled
click_text "to cooler places"
wait 20
expect "Move: T1"
shot layout-move-previewed
check_layout
